pytest test bas ek function hai jiska
naam test se shuru hota hai, aur jo assert use

93
00:05:43,842 --> 00:05:48,904
karta hai. good row ek fixture hai.
pytest parameter ka naam dekh kar ek nayi valid

94
00:05:48,904 --> 00:05:52,990
dictionary de deta hai, jo
conftest dot py mein ek baar define hai.

95
