har value ke liye chalata hai.

96
00:05:56,988 --> 00:06:02,025
Yahan paanch tests, har ek alag
required field hatata hai, aur check karta hai ki

97
00:06:02,025 --> 00:06:03,766
error ussi field ka naam le.

98
00:06:04,116 --> 00:06:09,025
Yeh test nau tarah ka kharab data deta
hai, chalaak True samet jo number ban kar

99
00:06:09,025 --> 00:06:13,259
aata hai, aur check karta hai ki
har ek sahi field ke liye reject ho.

100
00:06:14,559 --> 00:06:20,343
Tests asli network par depend nahi hone
chahiye, jo slow ho sakta hai ya band. httpx

101
00:06:20,343 --> 00:06:25,989
ka MockTransport network ki jagah ek
function laga deta hai jo fake responses deta

102
00:06:25,989 --> 00:06:26,265
hai.

103
00:06:26,615 --> 00:06:30,418
Toh hum check kar sakte hain ki
do downloads sahi order mein jude.

104
00:06:30,768 --> 00:06:35,465
Aur four zero four, ya list ke
alaawa response, ToolkitError banta hai.

105
00:06:35,685 --> 00:06:38,890
Yeh milliseconds mein
chalte hain, bina kisi server ke.

106
00:06:40,190 --> 00:06:41,509
Poora suite chalao.

107
00:06:41,729 --> 00:06:45,130
Forty two tests, sab
pass, ek second se bhi kam mein.

108
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:49,060
dash v ke saath pytest
har test ka naam dikhata hai.

109
00:06:49,410 --> 00:06:53,800
Aur mypy confirm karta hai ki
hamare saare type hints consistent hain.

110
00:06:55,100 --> 00:06:57,987
Pehla: package ke
andar ki file seedhe chalana.

111
00:06:58,207 --> 00:07:03,089
