115
00:07:12,533 --> 00:07:17,796
Environment deactivate hai, toh
system Python mein httpx install nahi hai.

116
00:07:18,016 --> 00:07:20,546
Fix: dot venv dobara activate karo.

117
00:07:21,846 --> 00:07:26,859
is not valid JSON ka matlab aksar
