code ko test kaise karte ho?

135
00:08:31,700 --> 00:08:37,025
Answer: network ki jagah ek fake
lagao. httpx MockTransport pehle se tayyar

136
00:08:37,025 --> 00:08:40,860
responses deta hai, four
zero four jaise errors samet.

137
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:44,530
Tests tez aur repeatable
bante hain, bina asli server ke.

138
00:08:44,750 --> 00:08:47,407
Trap: tests mein asli API call karna.

139
00:08:47,627 --> 00:08:51,276
Slow, kabhi pass kabhi fail,
aur paise ya keys ka nuksaan.

140
00:08:51,626 --> 00:08:55,143
Teesra: calculation aur
formatting ko alag kyun rakhte hain?

141
00:08:57,493 --> 00:09:03,529
